DE:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Siehste, wie alles blitzt und blinkt?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Das haben wir meinem Putzfimmel
zu verdanken! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Bu evi toparlamakla o kadar uğraştım ki,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
temizlik yeni hobim oldu galiba!
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ama çekinme!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Her köşeye bak!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Hiç rahatsız olmam! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
